    {
      "name": "create_list",
      "doc": "Add a list (column) to a board and return its id (`list-<ms>-<8 hex>`).\n\n# Examples\n```json\n{\"board_id\":\"<board id>\",\"name\":\"In progress\",\"rank\":null}\n```",
